    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Seed bank\"\nsubtitle: \"Seeds and cuttings from the collection\"\nformat: html\nexecute:\n  echo: false\n  warning: false\n  message: false\n---\n\n```{=html}\n<style>#quarto-header,.navbar{display:none !important;}</style>\n<div class=\"en-nav\">\n  <span class=\"brand\">Arboretum</span>\n  <a href=\"index.html\">Home</a>\n  <a href=\"collection.html\" class=\"current\">The Collection</a>\n  <a href=\"map.html\">Map</a>\n  <a href=\"self-guided-tour.html\">Self-guided tour</a>\n  <a href=\"wellbeing.html\">Wellbeing</a>\n  <a href=\"visit.html\">Visit</a>\n  <a href=\"sponsor.html\">Sponsor a tree</a>\n  <a href=\"donate.html\">Donate</a>\n  <a href=\"companies.html\">Companies</a>\n  <a href=\"contact.html\">Contact</a>\n  <span class=\"spacer\"></span>\n  <a href=\"experiences.html\" class=\"cta\">Book a visit</a>\n  <a href=\"../banco_semillas.html\" class=\"lang\">Español ▸</a>\n</div>\n```\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\nThe arboretum conserves **55 accessions** of seeds and cuttings — a basis for\n**propagation**, **restoration**, **education** and **exchange** with other botanical\ninstitutions. Each species links to its profile; where available we show its\n**conservation status (IUCN)** and its **origin**. Search by name or combine the filters.\n\n<p style=\"margin:.6rem 0 0;\">\n  <a href=\"../recursos/banco_semillas.csv\" download class=\"btn btn-outline-success btn-sm\" role=\"button\"><i class=\"bi bi-download\"></i> Download catalogue (CSV)</a>\n  <span style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#777;margin-left:.4rem;\">Open data · free to use with attribution</span>\n</p>\n\n\n<style>\n  .bs-stats{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.8rem;margin:1.1rem 0;}\n  .bs-stat{background:#f4f8f5;border-radius:10px;padding:.55rem 1.1rem;text-align:center;min-width:110px;}\n  .bs-stat .n{display:block;font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:#B8860B;line-height:1.1;}\n  .bs-stat .l{font-size:.78rem;color:#555;}\n  .bs-controles{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem;align-items:end;margin:1rem 0;}\n  .bs-controles label{font-size:.8rem;color:#555;display:block;}\n  .bs-controles input,.bs-controles select{padding:.4rem .5rem;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:6px;}\n  #bs-q{min-width:220px;}\n  #bs-tabla{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;}\n  #bs-tabla th,#bs-tabla td{text-align:left;padding:.45rem .6rem;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;vertical-align:top;}\n  #bs-tabla thead th{border-bottom:2px solid #1E4A38;color:#1E4A38;}\n  #bs-tabla tr:hover td{background:#f4f8f5;}\n  #bs-conteo{color:#666;font-size:.85rem;margin:.3rem 0 1rem;}\n</style>\n<div class=\"bs-stats\">\n  <div class=\"bs-stat\"><span class=\"n\">55</span><span class=\"l\">accessions</span></div>\n  <div class=\"bs-stat\"><span class=\"n\">23</span><span class=\"l\">families</span></div>\n  <div class=\"bs-stat\"><span class=\"n\">44</span><span class=\"l\">species</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bs-controles\">\n  <div><label>Search</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"bs-q\" placeholder=\"name or species...\"></div>\n  <div><label>Family</label><select id=\"bs-fam\"><option value=\"\">All</option><option value=\"Altingiaceae\">Altingiaceae</option><option value=\"Apocynaceae\">Apocynaceae</option><option value=\"Araucariaceae\">Araucariaceae</option><option value=\"Cannabaceae\">Cannabaceae</option><option value=\"Caprifoliaceae\">Caprifoliaceae</option><option value=\"Casuarinaceae\">Casuarinaceae</option><option value=\"Cupressaceae\">Cupressaceae</option><option value=\"Fabaceae\">Fabaceae</option><option value=\"Fagaceae\">Fagaceae</option><option value=\"Ginkgoaceae\">Ginkgoaceae</option><option value=\"Hypericaceae\">Hypericaceae</option><option value=\"Lauraceae\">Lauraceae</option><option value=\"Magnoliaceae\">Magnoliaceae</option><option value=\"Malvaceae\">Malvaceae</option><option value=\"Myrtaceae\">Myrtaceae</option><option value=\"Nothofagaceae\">Nothofagaceae</option><option value=\"Oleaceae\">Oleaceae</option><option value=\"Pina