forEach(function(e){e.addEventListener(\"input\",aplica);e.addEventListener(\"change\",aplica);});\n  aplica();\n})();\n</script>\n\n## Requesting or exchanging seeds\n\nAs part of the botanic-garden network (**ArbNet** accreditation and **BGCI** registration),\nwe make our collection available to institutions, researchers and restoration projects\nthrough an **Index Seminum** (a list of seeds available for exchange). To request material,\npropose an exchange or donate seeds of regional species, get in touch via our\n[contact](contact.qmd) page.\n\n---\n\n*Source: list of seeds and cuttings from Estancia La Constancia. Conservation status from the\n[IUCN Red List](https://www.iucnredlist.org). Updated by editing `data/banco_semillas.xlsx`.*\n",
